# My Website

IDK what to put up in this website, so for now it's a placeholder page with the Chrome dino game.

## Credits

Dino game from [wayou/t-rex-runner](https://github.com/wayou/t-rex-runner), extracted from Chromium's offline error page. Game code, sprites and sounds are copyright The Chromium Authors.

